WEBVTT

00:00:00.174 --> 00:00:02.364
Russia is five times bigger than India.

00:00:02.399 --> 00:00:05.349
Russia covers about 17
million square kilometres.

00:00:05.595 --> 00:00:07.785
India covers about 3.3 million.

00:00:07.880 --> 00:00:13.300
Stretch India's 1.4 billion people across
Russia's area and the crowding falls from

00:00:13.300 --> 00:00:17.210
roughly 430 people per
square kilometre to about 80.

00:00:17.321 --> 00:00:18.851
Same people, much more space.

00:00:19.046 --> 00:00:20.576
Would India still feel crowded?

